   "text": "The Krath seize the Empress Teta system from Cinnagar's throne; Ulic Qel-Droma falls to them and Exar Kun raises a Sith Brotherhood on Yavin's fourth moon. Together they raid Coruscant, turn Mandalore the Indomitable's clans loose, and burn the Jedi library at Ossus. Kun's spirit is sealed on Yavin; the Republic wins, at the price of a generation of Jedi.",
