   "text": "Mandalore the Ultimate's Neo-Crusaders burn Cathar and take the Outer Rim world by world — Serroco, Taris, Dxun — while the Jedi Council counsels patience. Revan and Malak lead the Jedi who refuse to wait. The war ends at Malachor V under the Mass Shadow Generator, with Mandalore dead and the Republic's saviours already half in the dark.",
