   "text": "Revan and Malak return from the Unknown Regions as Dark Lords with a fleet the Republic cannot match: the Star Forge over Lehon, feeding on a Rakata sun. Taris is levelled, the Dantooine enclave bombed, Korriban's academy reopened, Manaan bought with kolto. It ends when a redeemed Revan destroys the Forge; Malak dies aboard it.",
