   "text": "The Sith Triumvirate — Nihilus, Sion, Traya — hunts the surviving Jedi to extinction from Malachor V and Korriban while the Republic rebuilds Telos and lets Peragus mine its fuel. A Jedi exile from Malachor gathers what is left at Dxun, Nar Shaddaa and Onderon; Malachor V is finally destroyed, and the Sith with it — or so it seems.",
