  {
   "title": "What Revan found",
   "date": "c. 3,950 BBY",
   "view": {
    "focus": "Dromund Kaas",
    "w": 2400
   },
   "text": "The Republic is exhausted, its Jedi reduced to a handful. Revan has gone into the Unknown Regions after the thing that turned him: a true Sith Empire, intact since the Great Hyperspace War, ruling from Dromund Kaas under an Emperor who does not die. It is not ready yet. It can wait.",
